970	/**
971	 * Own devcommands-fix plugin (tools/valheim-plugins/NxeonDevAdmin — source and
972	 * build instructions live there), bind-mounted straight into the image's own
973	 * "drop your plugins here" folder for every BepInEx-enabled server. Found live
974	 * 2026-09-09: the only actively-maintained third-party mod for this
975	 * ("Server devcommands") throws a HarmonyException on Awake() against the
976	 * current game build (a stale Harmony patch target — Undefined target method
977	 * for Container::RPC_OpenRespons), which aborts the WHOLE plugin's
978	 * initialization, not just that one feature. Our own plugin does exactly one
979	 * thing — a single Harmony postfix on Terminal.IsCheatsEnabled() using ZNet's
980	 * own already-public LocalPlayerIsAdminOrHost() check — verified against the
981	 * actual current game assembly (not guessed), so it has far less surface area
